abstract: >-
  Python drawing code and frozen processed inputs for seven main figures and
  24 supplementary figures examining fibrocartilage-like ECM remodelling in
  human nucleus pulposus-related cells. The figures distinguish cell-state
  abundance, expression within the state and bulk-tissue signals. This release
  redraws completed results; it does not rerun the underlying raw-data analyses.
keywords:
  - intervertebral disc degeneration
  - nucleus pulposus
  - extracellular matrix
  - single-cell RNA sequencing
  - figure reproduction
